# Nothing in this file is optional.
#
# `vercel deploy` uploads the working directory. Without this list it would
# upload the private reference set, which is input only and is not ours to
# redistribute. The build does not read
# any of it: `build:data` reads content/ alone, and the originality check runs
# locally, never in CI.

# --- Reference corpus. INPUT ONLY. Never upload. ---
reference/
Study Pack - Math/
Study Pack - Physics/

# Private, machine-local pages: never part of the site.
*.local.tsx
app/papers/

# The kickoff brief quotes the corpus rules and is not part of the site.
csca-prep-claude-code-prompt.md

# --- Build output. Vercel rebuilds these itself. ---
node_modules/
.next/
out/
public/data/

# --- Not needed to build or serve the site ---
.git/
.gitignore
tests/
docs/
.claude/
.tmp/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
